'''The Angels Strike!''' (天使軍 強襲！''Tenshi-gun Kyōshū!'') is one of two [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event|Bikkuriman Collaboration]] [[Gauntlet]] added in the [[Version 9.7 Update]]. There are three new [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies found in this Gauntlet: [[Super Zeus (Enemy)|Super Zeus]], [[Shaman Khan (Enemy)|Shaman Khan]] and [[Heracrist (Enemy)|Heracrist]].

==Overview==
===About===
The Angels Strike! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Heaven's Gate Lvs.''' (天聖界 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Heaven's Gate Lv. can include XP, [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]] (Rare and Bikkuriman), [[Catfruit]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[The Angels Strike!/Heaven's Gate Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*The Angels Strike! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats|Japan]] Chapter 1.

